  "instructions": [
    "In a small bowl, mix together pistachios, dried figs, and dried apricots.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a large clay pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the onion and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the ginger and cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the cinnamon, cardamom, and cayenne pepper. Cook for 1 minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the pistachio mixture, salt, water, and almond milk. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from the heat and let it sit for 10 minutes, untouched.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with additional pistachios and dried fruits if desired."
